---
type Risk = {
  label: string;
  headline: string;
  equity_constraint: string;
  score: number;
};

type Props = {
  riskIcon: string;
  risk: Risk;
  generatedAtText: string;
};

const { riskIcon, risk, generatedAtText } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="macro-hero card">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">US MACRO RISK TERMINAL</span>
      <h1>美股宏观雷达</h1>
      <p>先决定风险预算，再选择ETF，最后等待关键价位。宏观只约束仓位，不替代交易触发。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>数据截止 {generatedAtText}</span>
      <span>时区 America/New_York</span>
      <span>免费公开数据 · 无券商权限</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="risk-command">
    <div class="risk-icon">{riskIcon}</div>
    <div>
      <span>MACRO RISK GATE</span>
      <strong>{risk.label} · {risk.headline}</strong>
      <p>{risk.equity_constraint}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="allocation">
      <small>风险评分 · 越高风险越大</small>
      <b>{risk.score} / 10</b>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
